00:00:56.020 --> 00:01:00.720
♪ The dawn piercing horn is being played by now ♪

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.850
♪ Is that a fantasy or just past memories? ♪

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.390
♪ Eyes wide open, but I can't tell ♪

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:12.350
♪ which side of the road am I running on ♪

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:19.720
♪ Would I know the memories and breaks mixed in morning light? ♪

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.100
♪ They said you shouldn't march on ♪

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.600
♪ They said you have to say goodbye ♪

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:30.100
♪ They say you can have no tomorrow but dark night ♪

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.720
♪ Over the finish line ♪

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.220
♪ I will restart my dream again ♪

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:37.020
♪ Even if it's dangerous ♪

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:42.220
♪ I will keep marching and get my crown back ♪

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.640
♪ Put on my armor and step to the unknown future ♪

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:50.810
♪ Hold on to my light on the road together with you ♪

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:51.890
♪ becomes the power that supports me ♪

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:55.470
♪ The morning light that burns in my heart ♪

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.850
♪ will blossom at dawn ♪

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.560
♪ Dawn of Glory on battlefield ♪

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.810
♪ I will show you my edge ♪

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:12.430
<b>Little Cold Hands</b>

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.660
Hottie, which dungeon you wanna go today?

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:21.250
Doesn't matter.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.410
We'll go wherever is needed.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.660
You already had Hottie a few days ago!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:29.370
Not again.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.040
Get lost!

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:32.580
You get lost!

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:36.080
Why would you even invite Hottie for that crappy dungeon?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.000
First come, first served.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:38.950
Show some respect, OK?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.200
We applied first!

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:43.500
First my ass!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.290
Check out the chat!

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:45.040
I came first!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.620
No, it's me!

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:46.370
Well...

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.660
I came first!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.870
Calm down.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.790
Who's been with me before can wait for the next round.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.870
Let those who haven't tried come first.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:53.540
OK?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.540
See, even Hottie said so.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:57.160
You better behave.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.660
Got time to do a dungeon?

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:00.950
You can't just crush in a queue.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:01.620
Got the hell...

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:02.890
President?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.140
Hi...

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.700
Level 70 Boss North Bridge Mage Modank has popped.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.330
He's our top priority this week.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.660
We need your help to take him down.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.200
Sure.

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:38.790
No.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.830
The Boss will notice us once we step on the bridge.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.160
Do we have to go hard on him?

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:55.600
It's Dazzling Spring again.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.370
It's Dazzling Spring again.
(Blue Brook, Changing Spring)

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.100
He stole our Boss last week.
(Blue Brook, Changing Spring)

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:57.810
He stole our Boss last week.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:58.430
(Blossom Valley, Blooming Blossom)

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.750
(Herb Garden, Arisaema)

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.700
We shouldn't let him get on the bridge at the first place.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.200
He took the lead again.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.500
What's your opinion on this?

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.790
North Bridge Mega will generate aggro
to whoever steps on the North Bridge.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:14.370
The longer you stay on the Bridge,
the more aggro you'll have.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.490
And that guy can stay above the bridge with his moves.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.370
He will be in dominant position from that height.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.330
With the terrain of the North Bridge,

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.910
he can block others from getting onto the bridge.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.040
Since he has already taken the lead,

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.700
it's not easy to break his advantage.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.040
So what can we do?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:32.870
I'll go first.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.620
I'll kill Dazzling Spring.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.370
Then you attract the Boss over, finish him at the bridgehead.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.290
How are you going to kill Dazzling Spring?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.370
Just go in and kill him.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:47.000
After I got in, pin down other players of Blossom Valley.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.000
He just went straight up there.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.500
Even he's not dead, his HP will be running really low.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:06.910
Clerics, see if you can heal him from this distance.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.330
OK.

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:11.060
One minute later

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.700
The way Dazzling Spring's fighting,
we can't even locate Hottie.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:25.750
Calm down.

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:27.910
They can't stay in the smoke all the time.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:31.750
The moment they jump out, it will be my call to heal.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.450
He's out of your range.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.480
Let's go in.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.580
You haven't taken on any serious actions,

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.250
because you want to lure me out of
the range of the healing skills, right?

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.950
Not only that.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.250
Say goodbye to your Clerics.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:58.660
Really?

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.120
Check it for yourself down there.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.620
Spell Reflection.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.500
His HP is turning red.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.750
It's over.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.500
Not so fast.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.790
It's not over yet.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.700
Holy Commandment Light?

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.450
When?

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.000
Nice timing.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.750
When did this Cleric come up here?

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.050
Did she get here using the shadows I created?

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:03.410
Little Cold Hands.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.950
You gonna get cold underwater.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.450
Got addicted bullying the Clerics?

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:23.250
Shit.

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:24.660
Knight's Provoke.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.580
Let's all get cold underwater.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.450
You might not want the Boss, but I do.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:30.910
Piss off!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.370
Dazzling Spring has been taken down.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.700
Rush to the bridge!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:41.290
Let's go!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.330
Solving that Blossom Valley's maniac in such a way,

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:48.870
he is indeed something.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:52.750
Got errands to attend to.
(From Unrivaled Super Hottie)

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:53.500
Gotta go.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:54.580
You guys continue

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.000
What do you mean "gotta go"?

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:01.250
You're in the middle of the dungeon,
how can you just leave like that?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.330
I'm busy putting together my own team.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.000
Ain't got time for your little play.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.580
Why did he suddenly bring up this?

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.620
Is he going to have a showdown?

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.200
Then what was he doing back there?

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.160
If I come, it won't be helping you with the Boss.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.580
It will be stealing your Boss.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:17.910
Are you sure you want me back?

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.700
How can an undercover be so cocky?

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.830
This is so annoying!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.580
Kill them!

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:33.700
President.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.620
Samsara just came from the opposite.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:41.660
Take it! Take it!

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:42.910
We gotta take down this spot.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.290
Cover the Clerics.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.290
Send them up there.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.410
How come their lead is not Samsara's President?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.200
Who is that Warlock?

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.080
They said he is a newly joined master of Samsara.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.250
Great at tactics.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:59.120
Don't go straight ahead!

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.340
Go around them over there!

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.290
Man, you're an Assassin.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.120
Don't barge about like a Knight.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:08.870
Be dirty.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.790
Be low.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.120
Loser, you're not even qualified to attack me.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:40.660
Still guarding against me?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.410
Come on, put the gun away.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.000
It's over.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.450
You should be ashamed of yourself.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.870
If it weren't that Cleric, you would be dead by now.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:50.410
That Holy Commandment Light, wasn't it wonderful?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.660
If she actually aimed at that timing, then it was impressive.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.220
Who is she?

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.900
A player in Tyranny.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.200
Player?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.040
Just a regular player?

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.500
Tell me about it.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.040
Knows how to use the shadows to cover her moves.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:09.200
And the ability to seize the opportunity at critical
moments, along with the observation and judgment.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.080
She's almost a professional.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.580
She's a talent.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:13.700
I agree!

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:19.580
So you went undercover in Tyranny with
that crappy Knight account for a Cleric?

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.160
There're no other options for me.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.370
You gods aim too high.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.620
I have to fish from the regular players.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:30.450
I mean, if I want a Cleric, I have to start from Tyranny.

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:33.450
After all, Tyranny has the No.1 Cleric, Zhang Xinjie.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.450
No wonder you came in as a Knight.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.910
Main Tank is the best approach to test the Cleric.

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.120
You found such a talent.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.580
You got quite lucky.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.330
Didn't expect you to comment on <i>luck</i>.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:49.950
Where's that Cleric?

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.160
Probably drowned and died.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:53.160
Drowned and died?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.580
For real?

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:59.330
I mean, if she's an all round player with no flaws at all,

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.200
then she won't be there for me to tap.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.270
She will be scouted long ago.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:10.410
What is this flaw that buried her talents?

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:13.450
According to my observation,
she has a great sense of timing.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:15.490
But her operation is just so so.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.140
When it comes to a complex
situation, her reaction is also slow.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:20.820
That's true.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.450
If she can't keep up with the operation,

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.950
she won't be showing her strengths in a team.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:26.670
Wait...

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.370
Did you use me as an experiment?

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:30.620
Don't put it that way.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.950
I'm just trying her out with you.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:37.790
Calm down and be civilized.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.120
How about you?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:41.870
Aren't you ready to come back?

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:44.750
Why are you still helping Blossom Valley with that Boss?

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:45.790
What?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.250
Still feeling guilty?

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:49.750
I owe it to them.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.200
Sun Zheping retired in season five due to hand injury.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.200
Zhang Jiale took over as the captain.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.580
Yet failed to attain the championship once again.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.290
We will always support you, Captain Zhang Jiale!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.080
It's a pity.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:01.540
I'm tired.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.290
It's been a good year.

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:03.330
All you needed was a little bit of luck.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.330
I want to retire.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.160
You're not going back to Hundred Blossoms?

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.250
Well, good luck.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:19.290
Definitely.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.000
Alright.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:23.500
I'll go back to get the Boss.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.870
Blossom Valley probably got aced by now.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:28.620
That's okay.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.950
We can always be revived.

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.250
This is the best part about online games
compared to the real competition.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.250
I wish you success then.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.000
I have achieved my goal.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.410
I will cut the Boss some slack this time.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.080
Then I wish you get what you want as well.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.160
I hope that Cleric can live up to you.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:52.370
And not disdain your status as the master of Excellent Era.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:12:59.910
Take on Injury Reduction.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:00.950
Let's hit them again.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.620
OK!

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:04.870
It's Dazzling Spring.

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:06.370
Dazzling Spring is back!

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.290
Blossom Valley almost got aced.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.870
What good can he be coming back here alone?

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.790
My irresponsible retirement had failed Hundred Blossoms once.

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:20.290
Yet, I'm afraid I have to abandon them again.

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:22.080
Cap Zhang, go get them!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:23.540
I'm sorry.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:28.870
But there's this one thing I want even I have to risk it all.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:30.660
The championship.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.200
I won't ask for forgiveness.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.700
Just take this as my final atonement.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:48.100
The King's Avatar 2

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.450
You, you...

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:54.330
You went into Tyranny just for a Cleric?

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.870
What you looking at?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.370
About getting the Cleric in, why don't you go do it?

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.660
Why me?

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.370
I don't even know him.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.290
It doesn't matter.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.950
Just say you appreciate his talent,
and you are putting together a team.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:09.950
See if he's interested.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.660
If it's that simple, then why won't you go?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.250
I'm just trying to be nice.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.950
He's a fan of Tyranny.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.450
A hardcore supporter of Zhang Xinjie.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.750
If I go in and tell him like,

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:21.870
I'm Ye Qiu, come with me.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.620
He's gonna shit on me.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.410
Down with Ye Qiu!

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:27.120
Down with Excellent Era!

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:29.330
OK.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:35.410
Is this the right place for our appointment?

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:37.450
(Tyranny, Little Cold Hands)

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.250
There she is.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.700
Is that her?

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.250
Little Cold Hands.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.160
It's a girl.

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.450
She's not a man, is she?

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.990
Hi, Nostradamus.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.620
Hello.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.790
Female look with a male voice.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.250
Doesn't seem to be that bad.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.910
I've been following you.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.250
The battle at North Bridge.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.080
That Holy Commandment Light was amazing.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.000
It's all right.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.750
I did get lucky on that one.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.910
You have great skills.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.040
I'm putting together a team.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.120
We need a Cleric.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.370
Would you like to join us?

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.720
Ye Qiu's team?

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.580
We got busted.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.290
Say what you have to say then.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:29.350
Yes.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:30.510
Ye Qiu's team.

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.250
Then maybe this team will be fun.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.330
Unrivaled Super Hottie is Ye Qiu, right?

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:38.410
Yes.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.120
What's he after with Tyranny?

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:45.330
He was very polite, until Ye Qiu came into the conversation.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.750
Nice play.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:48.620
Nothing.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.160
It's just a side account for him to practice more.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:52.910
Practice?

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.790
With his level,

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:57.660
coming down to a mid-stream team, how is that practice?

00:15:58.120 --> 00:15:58.830
OK.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.370
Anyway, I feel that you are pretty good.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.250
So, interested in joining us?

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:05.660
I wanna know your answer.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:08.620
If it's really Ye Qiu, then I'm a bit interested.

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:13.080
But teaming up with Ye Qiu,
equals aiming for the Pro League.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.000
That means I have to be a professional gamer.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.500
This is gonna be an important step in my life.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:22.000
You expect me to give you a definite answer right now?

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.540
Well, take your time then.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:26.910
I'll wait for your reply.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.000
You just gonna leave like that?

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.080
What else do you want?

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.660
You should at least introduce your
current situation and long-term plans.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:35.430
Macro

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:35.520
Roster

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:35.600
Fund

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.370
Tactic

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.790
For example, personnel composition besides Ye Qiu.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.500
How much investment will the team have?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.120
What is your direction and the goal to your development?

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.660
Welfare, contract duration,

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:46.950
insurance and housing funds, food and accommodation?

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:51.540
He is taking this seriously.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:53.370
OK.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:54.370
Let me walk you through.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.910
Our team is led by Ye Qiu.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.290
At present, we're in the preparatory stage.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.930
We will sign up for the Challenge in the next
season to win over the ticket of the Pro League.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.620
About the roster, we are still trying.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.120
Investment...

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.870
Well, I'm kind of the sponsor.

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:13.540
If you are really interested, we can
sit down and talk about your pay.

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.040
So you are the boss.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:18.500
What do you mean by "kind of"?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.660
Are you not sure about this investment?

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.750
It that why you gave such a vague answer?

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.830
Besides, to win the entry through Challenge,

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.290
even with a master like Ye Qiu,

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.580
there's no guarantee that you can make it to the end.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.620
Does that mean we'll only get official
contracts after the team enters the League?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.410
If not, then the temporary contracts
will be terminated automatically.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.120
We'll just go back to wherever we came from.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.660
These are still under discussion.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.250
In fact, the roster is mainly taken care of by Ye Qiu.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.000
Maybe I should get him to talk to you.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.290
So you don't have a clue.

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.620
That's not very responsible as the boss, is that?

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:51.870
Leave it all to Ye Qiu.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.620
Is he your relative or what?

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:56.790
Go ask him.

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:58.700
You go talk to him.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:00.620
About what?

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.700
Team planning.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.620
Roster.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:03.500
Amount of investment.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.330
With or without contract.

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.120
What kind of contract?

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:06.160
Insurance and housing.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:06.870
Food and compensation.

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.790
And whether you and I are related.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:14.330
He has thought it through.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:20.120
I am Ye Qiu.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.160
I heard you have a lot of questions.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:27.500
First of all, you're the one who
picked me not that silly rabbit, is it?

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.120
It was me.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.290
And that silly rabbit, we are not related.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.450
But she's gonna be our boss.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:40.200
And she can hear every single word we just said.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.120
Hello, boss.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.290
I hope after you heard my warning,

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.250
you can realize that

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:47.790
the Challenge can be risky.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.040
You need to be careful with your investment.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:52.540
So, let's get back to business.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.790
Please introduce the current situation of this new team.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:59.620
Just like our boss said, everything is uncertain.

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:02.450
If we don't get enough players before the Challenge,

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:04.410
all the rest won't count.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.580
Let's say we put up the team in time,

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.870
you're that confident about the Challenge?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.910
As long as it's a game, no one is 100% sure.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:17.700
But as a self-made team, if we
can't even play well in Challenge,

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:20.830
then even we got into the League,
it'll just be a one time thing.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:27.450
You're saying the Challenge is to
test the ability and value of this team.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.170
Exactly.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:32.870
The one who really needs to take on
the risk if we're out, is just me.

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.540
All you have to do is to perform well.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.660
Then the experience in Challenge can
help you to secure a bright enough future.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:46.200
OK.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.910
For me, it is indeed a rare opportunity.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.450
You thought about this with all the details.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.580
It seems that you are very interested in becoming a Pro.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.200
Of course.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.830
I think most of the Glory players have this kind of a fantasy.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:03.160
Now you have a chance to make this fantasy real.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.620
What's the name of your team?

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:08.160
Happy.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:12.450
Happy?

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.700
Sounds like a tiny grocery by the side of the road.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:16.450
Maybe a convenience store or a net cafe?

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:19.700
You got it right.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:20.750
What are you laughing at?

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:22.620
Shut up!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.330
Let me do a final check.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.250
Where we are on the team right now?

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.750
You and me included, we have four.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.040
And the other two are...?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:33.660
A Warlock.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.450
You probably won't be seeing him recently.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:36.950
And a Battle Mage.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:38.450
He's in District 10 now.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.000
How about Mumu?

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:41.080
You didn't count her in.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.200
She won't be there for the Challenge.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:44.670
Mumu?

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.370
Su Mucheng?

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:50.790
If we can make it to the Pro League, she'll be with us.

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:54.200
Finally, some good news.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.700
And that Steamed Bun?

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.410
I haven't talked to him yet.

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.330
Not sure what he might think.

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:02.080
Steamed Bun can think?

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.540
Listen to yourself.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:05.750
He's not a real bun.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.870
He's also human being.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.370
Maybe we should let him know now?

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.290
I'll go talk to him.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.540
Or let's have a team chat group.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:24.160
Gotta play dirty, okay?

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.500
Wait, boss is adding me to a group chat.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:35.750
OK.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.150
(Chasing Haze invites you to the group chat Team Happy)

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.150
(Member: Lord Grim, Chasing Haze)

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.820
(Windward Formation, Steamed Bun Invasion, Soft Mist are now in)

